Colin

I don't know of a method to combine the data from both data sources in using design-based inference. However, the topic is touched upon in a model-based context in a paper by Miller et al. (2021):

https://peerj.com/articles/12113/
 <https://peerj.com/articles/12113/>
Extending density surface models to include multiple and double-observer survey data <https://peerj.com/articles/12113/>
peerj.com <http://peerj.com>

Perhaps others on the list might offer some other ideas.
