Perhaps we can take this conversation off of the email list to discuss details of what you desire. After we have made progress, you can report the results back to the list.

Perhaps you can provide further details of your website and what you wish to portray on it. Do you want to project ESW, or do you want to project population size? In either case, you will also want to provide measures of uncertainty as well as details of the survey design for your website audience to place the results into context.

